# MERIDIAN — MASTER PROMPT: PHASE 4
## Autonomous Trade Execution, PayPal Sandbox, Shipment Monitoring, Cryptographic Verification, Evidence Management and Dispute Resolution

You are developing Phase 4 of Meridian, an international B2B trade workflow orchestration SaaS platform.

Phase 4 begins only after Phase 3 has successfully completed the trade negotiation, preparation and execution of Agreement 2.

Your responsibility is to implement a fully connected, reliable and repeatable operational trade workflow.

The objective is to allow the designated Meridian demo buyer and seller to complete an entire international trade demonstration, including:

- Digital agreement signing and verification records.
- Actual PayPal Sandbox checkout redirection and virtual payment approval.
- Payment authorization and supported settlement.
- Shipment preparation and dispatch.
- Product and packaging photograph uploads.
- Telemetry monitoring and cryptographic message verification.
- AI anomaly detection.
- Delivery and buyer inspection.
- One complete internal trade-dispute demonstration.
- Buyer and seller dispute responses.
- Settlement workflow.
- Final PDF audit dossier.

This is a critical implementation stage. Prioritize backend correctness, integration reliability, security, data consistency and a smooth user experience.

